WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Welcome to AI Weekend Study Guide. I’m Brian

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.160
Kennedy Jr. Your goal is a checked practice

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.760
artifact and follow-up plan. Choose one small practice

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.960
task using synthetic or public material, and write

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:15.040
how you will check the result. Keep your

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.600
work private, record what you tried, and set

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.920
a review date. A study guide is not

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.120
evidence of current provider access, paid course completion

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.720
or implementation success.
